+# Instructions append
+
+## Return value
+
+`recite(start, take=1)` returns `take` verses as a list of strings, one string per line of the song, beginning with the verse that starts with `start` green bottles and counting down by one bottle per verse.
+Consecutive verses are separated by an empty string `""`; there is no empty string before the first verse or after the last one.
+
+For example, `recite(start=4, take=2)` returns nine strings: the four lines of the verse that begins "Four green bottles hanging on the wall,", then `""`, then the four lines of the verse that begins "Three green bottles hanging on the wall,".
+
